      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">RESULT 04/08/26</h2>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">✅ Implementation: Update views_total_likes_per_user</h2>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The existing view keeps <code class=\"notranslate\">total_likes</code> and adds <code class=\"notranslate\">total_likes_public</code> for profile totals.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">DDL</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW public.views_total_likes_per_user AS\nSELECT\n    posts.user_id,\n    COUNT(&quot;like&quot;.post_id) AS total_likes,\n    COUNT(&quot;like&quot;.post_id) FILTER (\n        WHERE posts.is_publish = TRUE\n          AND posts.visibility &lt;&gt; 'private'\n    ) AS total_likes_public\nFROM panorra_dev.public.&quot;like&quot;\nLEFT JOIN panorra_dev.public.posts ON &quot;like&quot;.post_id = posts.id\nGROUP BY posts.user_id;\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">VIEW</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">public</span>.views_total_likes_per_user <span class=\"pl-k\">AS</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">SELECT</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">posts</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">user_id</span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">COUNT</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>like<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>.post_id) <span class=\"pl-k\">AS</span> total_likes,\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">COUNT</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>like<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>.post_id) FILTER (\n        <span class=\"pl-k\">WHERE</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">posts</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">is_publish</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> TRUE\n          <span class=\"pl-k\">AND</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">posts</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">visibility</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">&lt;&gt;</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>private<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>\n    ) <span class=\"pl-k\">AS</span> total_likes_public\n<span class=\"pl-k\">FROM</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">panorra_dev</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">public</span>.<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>like<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">LEFT JOIN</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">panorra_dev</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">public</span>.posts <span class=\"pl-k\">ON</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>like<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>.post_id <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">posts</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">id</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">GROUP BY</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">posts</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">user_id</span>;</pre></div>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Behavior</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">total_likes</code> remains the total of all like rows per post owner.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">total_likes_public</code> counts only published, non-private post likes.</li>\n<li>Regular-view queries remain real-time against current table rows.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">File Changed</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">docs/migrations/views/DDL_views_total_likes_per_user.sql</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Deployment</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Apply the updated DDL before deploying API code that reads <code class=\"notranslate\">total_likes_public</code>.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The existing view keeps <code class=\"notranslate\">total_likes</code> and adds <code class=\"notranslate\">total_likes_public</code> for profile totals.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">DDL</h2>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-sql notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW public.views_total_likes_per_user AS\nSELECT\n    posts.user_id,\n    COUNT(&quot;like&quot;.post_id) AS total_likes,\n    COUNT(&qu